equation by ${e}^{12x-{x}^{3}}$ and solve the resulting equation. \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12-3{x}^{2} & =0 \\\\ 3(4-{x}^{2}) & =0 \\\\ (2-x)(2+x) & =0 \\\\ x & =-2,\\,2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nTherefore, $f(x)$ has stationary points at $x=-2$ and $x=2.$\n\n- Second, we note that ${f}^{′}(x)$ exists for all values of $x$ in the domain of $f(x).$ So $f(x)$ has no non-stationary critical points.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the critical points of $f(x)$ are $x=-2$ and $x=2.$" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283098 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283099 13194139534268 true] [17592186283098 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283100 13194139534268 true] [17592186283098 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283101 13194139534268 true] [17592186283098 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283102 13194139534268 true] [17592186283098 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283103 13194139534268 true] [17592186283098 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534268 true] [17592186283098 1041 "selection" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283098 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283102 13194139534268 true] [17592186283098 1110 #uuid "eb7aac87-d32c-5242-bdef-f3accb76fdb0" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283099 1034 "$x=2$ only" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283099 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534268 true] [17592186283099 1111 #uuid "2cedfade-ee75-59e1-ba37-303041bc54f1" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283100 1034 "$x=-3$ only" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283100 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534268 true] [17592186283100 1111 #uuid "d3d7b048-b736-5f00-8f74-3a2a1f611307" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283101 1034 "$x=-1$ and $x=4$" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283101 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534268 true] [17592186283101 1111 #uuid "d268f45b-b3c1-52bd-b251-00bf5f5b3da2" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283102 1034 "$x=-2$ and $x=2$" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283102 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534268 true] [17592186283102 1111 #uuid "5c0624be-188f-505f-8d9a-3a6e3bd93f9d" 13194139534268 true] [17592186283103 1034 "$x=-4$ and $x=3$" 13194139534